{
  "01-intro": [
    {
      "text": "ResourceHive is a platform for university communities to share resources.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3940,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "In this video, I will show a member booking a resource, then follow that",
      "startMs": 4860,
      "endMs": 8680,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "same action through the code and deployment behind it.",
      "startMs": 8680,
      "endMs": 11620,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "02-problem": [
    {
      "text": "A department or club may own equipment, rooms, or other useful items,",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4480,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "while students elsewhere do not know what is available or who can use it.",
      "startMs": 4880,
      "endMs": 8720,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Availability also changes.",
      "startMs": 9320,
      "endMs": 10620,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "A simple list is not enough when two people can try to reserve the same",
      "startMs": 11460,
      "endMs": 14960,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "time.",
      "startMs": 14960,
      "endMs": 15300,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "ResourceHive brings discovery, access rules, published time slots, and",
      "startMs": 16180,
      "endMs": 20240,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "bookings into one workflow.",
      "startMs": 20240,
      "endMs": 21740,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "03-overview": [
    {
      "text": "The dashboard gives members a resource catalogue, organization information,",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3640,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "their bookings, and notifications.",
      "startMs": 4460,
      "endMs": 5760,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Administrators can manage resources and review bookings for the",
      "startMs": 6860,
      "endMs": 10040,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "organizations they administer.",
      "startMs": 10040,
      "endMs": 11240,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I will focus on one small task that connects the interface to the",
      "startMs": 12200,
      "endMs": 15580,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "implementation:",
      "startMs": 15580,
      "endMs": 16000,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "reserving a published slot.",
      "startMs": 17100,
      "endMs": 18380,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "04-product-workflow": [
    {
      "text": "Here is the resource catalogue.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 2080,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "A member can browse the items shared with their organization and open a",
      "startMs": 2080,
      "endMs": 5700,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "resource for more detail.",
      "startMs": 5700,
      "endMs": 6820,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The detail page identifies its owner, shows its booking cost in points, and",
      "startMs": 7580,
      "endMs": 12040,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "explains that access, availability,",
      "startMs": 12040,
      "endMs": 13760,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "and balance will be checked before a reservation is confirmed.",
      "startMs": 14500,
      "endMs": 17460,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I open Create booking. The dialog loads future published slots for this",
      "startMs": 18440,
      "endMs": 22840,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "specific resource.",
      "startMs": 22840,
      "endMs": 23640,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "These times are displayed in the viewer's local timezone.",
      "startMs": 24480,
      "endMs": 27720,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I choose one available time and confirm.",
      "startMs": 27720,
      "endMs": 29660,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The interface sends the selected slot identifier to the booking API; it does",
      "startMs": 29660,
      "endMs": 34640,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "not decide on its own whether the slot is safe to reserve.",
      "startMs": 34640,
      "endMs": 37440,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The confirmation gives a booking reference, the scheduled time, and any",
      "startMs": 38220,
      "endMs": 41940,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "points deducted.",
      "startMs": 41940,
      "endMs": 42560,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "There is also a receipt download action.",
      "startMs": 43440,
      "endMs": 45240,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "From the Bookings page, the member can review upcoming and past reservations",
      "startMs": 45960,
      "endMs": 49560,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "and keep the reference available.",
      "startMs": 49560,
      "endMs": 51400,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the complete user action we will now trace behind the screen.",
      "startMs": 52140,
      "endMs": 55560,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The application also has organization membership, notifications, disputes,",
      "startMs": 56120,
      "endMs": 60600,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "and analytics views.",
      "startMs": 60980,
      "endMs": 61880,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "They are useful context, but this booking gives us a clearer way to explain",
      "startMs": 62540,
      "endMs": 66380,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "how the pieces work together.",
      "startMs": 66380,
      "endMs": 67860,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "05-bridge": [
    {
      "text": "So that is what the member sees.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 1500,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "But what has to happen between clicking Confirm and showing this result?",
      "startMs": 2360,
      "endMs": 5800,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The important thing is that the booking service, rather than the browser,",
      "startMs": 6700,
      "endMs": 10020,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "makes the final decision about access, slot availability, and points.",
      "startMs": 10500,
      "endMs": 14600,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "06-architecture": [
    {
      "text": "The interface is a Next.js application.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 1940,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The backend is split into four NestJS services: Identity, Resource,",
      "startMs": 2860,
      "endMs": 7500,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Booking, and Notification.",
      "startMs": 8020,
      "endMs": 9060,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no separate Points service in this repository.",
      "startMs": 10020,
      "endMs": 12360,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Points logic lives in Booking Service.",
      "startMs": 12360,
      "endMs": 15100,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Public API requests first meet Caddy, which routes each path to the",
      "startMs": 15840,
      "endMs": 20100,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "appropriate private service.",
      "startMs": 20100,
      "endMs": 21380,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Identity handles accounts and authentication.",
      "startMs": 22140,
      "endMs": 24240,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Resource handles organizations,",
      "startMs": 25220,
      "endMs": 26320,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "memberships, and the resource catalogue.",
      "startMs": 27140,
      "endMs": 28700,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Booking owns slots, reservations,",
      "startMs": 28700,
      "endMs": 31140,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "points, disputes, and analytics.",
      "startMs": 31880,
      "endMs": 33700,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Notification processes messages and realtime events.",
      "startMs": 34440,
      "endMs": 37400,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The services use Prisma with PostgreSQL.",
      "startMs": 38220,
      "endMs": 40200,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The configured production database is hosted by Neon.",
      "startMs": 41020,
      "endMs": 43460,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Kafka, configured through Aiven, carries notification related events.",
      "startMs": 44520,
      "endMs": 47980,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "This diagram shows logical responsibilities and the actual configured",
      "startMs": 48680,
      "endMs": 52360,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "connections;",
      "startMs": 52360,
      "endMs": 52820,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "the four service boxes do not mean four separate machines.",
      "startMs": 53700,
      "endMs": 56480,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "07-booking-request": [
    {
      "text": "Now follow the selected slot.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 1340,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The browser posts it to the bookings endpoint.",
      "startMs": 2060,
      "endMs": 3960,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Caddy sends that path to Booking Service, where a guard requires an",
      "startMs": 4700,
      "endMs": 8200,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "authenticated user. The service checks the member's tenant context, finds",
      "startMs": 8200,
      "endMs": 12560,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "the slot, and checks that its resource is active and accessible.",
      "startMs": 12560,
      "endMs": 15900,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "It rejects a slot that has already started or has an existing booking.",
      "startMs": 16700,
      "endMs": 20120,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "If the resource has a point cost, it also checks the member's balance.",
      "startMs": 20720,
      "endMs": 24180,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The booking record and any point deduction are written within one",
      "startMs": 24880,
      "endMs": 28160,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "serializable database transaction.",
      "startMs": 28160,
      "endMs": 29820,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "That means the reservation and its point entry succeed together or fail",
      "startMs": 29820,
      "endMs": 34620,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "together.",
      "startMs": 34620,
      "endMs": 34920,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The database also has a constraint allowing only one active booking per",
      "startMs": 35580,
      "endMs": 39500,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "slot. A concurrency test sends two requests for the same slot and expects",
      "startMs": 39500,
      "endMs": 44100,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "exactly one to succeed.",
      "startMs": 44100,
      "endMs": 45680,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "After the transaction commits, Booking Service attempts to publish booking",
      "startMs": 46340,
      "endMs": 50100,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "notifications. Notification Service can turn the booking event into an",
      "startMs": 50100,
      "endMs": 54180,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "in-app or push notification and emit a realtime update.",
      "startMs": 54180,
      "endMs": 57440,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "This part is separate from the atomic database write, so we should not",
      "startMs": 58080,
      "endMs": 61040,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "describe notification delivery as part of the booking transaction.",
      "startMs": 61040,
      "endMs": 63700,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "08-deployment": [
    {
      "text": "In the configured production setup, the Next.js frontend is on Vercel.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3960,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Caddy and the four backend services run as containers on one Linode virtual",
      "startMs": 4620,
      "endMs": 8680,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "machine.",
      "startMs": 8680,
      "endMs": 9100,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Only Caddy exposes the public backend ports; it forwards traffic to the",
      "startMs": 10080,
      "endMs": 13980,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "services on the private Docker network.",
      "startMs": 13980,
      "endMs": 15840,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "PostgreSQL is hosted separately on Neon, and Kafka is managed separately on",
      "startMs": 16560,
      "endMs": 21560,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Aiven.",
      "startMs": 21560,
      "endMs": 21900,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The deployment workflow builds four service images, publishes them to GitHub",
      "startMs": 22560,
      "endMs": 26380,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Container Registry,",
      "startMs": 26380,
      "endMs": 27240,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "runs Prisma migrations, and updates the containers on Linode.",
      "startMs": 27960,
      "endMs": 31200,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The services are separated in code and containers, while the current",
      "startMs": 31820,
      "endMs": 35300,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "deployment keeps them together on one VM.",
      "startMs": 35300,
      "endMs": 37500,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "09-close": [
    {
      "text": "ResourceHive connects a practical member workflow to explicit backend rules.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4220,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "A user sees a straightforward reservation, while the implementation checks",
      "startMs": 5060,
      "endMs": 8840,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "organization access, prevents competing bookings,",
      "startMs": 8840,
      "endMs": 11800,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "records points consistently,",
      "startMs": 12480,
      "endMs": 13380,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "and sends updates through a separate notification path.",
      "startMs": 14200,
      "endMs": 16620,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the central design of the project:",
      "startMs": 17380,
      "endMs": 19300,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "make shared resources easier to use, with booking rules enforced where they",
      "startMs": 20060,
      "endMs": 24300,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "matter.",
      "startMs": 24300,
      "endMs": 24460,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "10.1": [
    {
      "text": "Booking is one part of sharing a resource.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 1960,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The other is deciding who belongs to the organization that owns it.",
      "startMs": 2780,
      "endMs": 6460,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "First, from the member's account, I request membership in the Engineering",
      "startMs": 7240,
      "endMs": 10920,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Faculty.",
      "startMs": 10920,
      "endMs": 11540,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "After I submit the request, its status shows as Pending.",
      "startMs": 12280,
      "endMs": 16220,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The request is now waiting for an administrator to review it.",
      "startMs": 16220,
      "endMs": 19040,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "10.2": [
    {
      "text": "Next, I switch to the Engineering Faculty administrator's member list.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3740,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The same member appears under Pending requests.",
      "startMs": 4580,
      "endMs": 6860,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I choose Approve and confirm the decision.",
      "startMs": 7840,
      "endMs": 9860,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "10.3": [
    {
      "text": "Finally, I return to the member's account and refresh My memberships.",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3500,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The Engineering Faculty status changes from Pending to Approved.",
      "startMs": 4320,
      "endMs": 7620,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "We have now seen the complete membership flow: the member requests access,",
      "startMs": 8520,
      "endMs": 12480,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "the administrator approves it, and the member sees the updated result.",
      "startMs": 13040,
      "endMs": 16460,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "10.4": [
    {
